msgstr ""

msgid "`Cat_`, with a trailing underscore, is the Jakarta Persistence metamodel. Its string attribute constants can be used in repository queries."
msgstr ""

msgid "Both are generated in the same package as `Cat`; the examples below assume `org.acme`."
