msgid "Dynamically built queries"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"When defining finder and query operations on a repository, queries are validated and generated at build time.\n"
"For dynamic filtering and sorting, prefer type-safe restrictions and ordering before using query strings."
msgstr ""

msgid "Type-safe restrictions and ordering"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Jakarta Data 1.1 provides `Restriction` parameters for finder and query methods. For example, add this method to\n"
"`Cat.Repo`:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Use the <<generated-metamodels,generated Jakarta Data metamodel>> `_Cat` for type-safe restrictions and ordering:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The attribute types determine which comparisons are available and which values they accept. Restrictions can be\n"
"combined conditionally to build a query from user-supplied search criteria. See the Hibernate documentation on\n"
"link:https://docs.hibernate.org/orm/{hibernate-orm-version-major-minor}/introduction/html_single/#restrictions-and-ordering[restrictions and ordering]\n"
"and the link:{jakarta-data-spec-url}[Jakarta Data specification] for the full APIs."
